# Implementation Plan - 3D Layout Overhaul & Interaction

## Goal
Reimagine the 3D layout engine to be adaptable (Ground/Roof), interactive (Manual Add/Remove), and visually superior (Real Textures).

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Manual Editing Approach**: Direct 3D clicking is limited in Streamlit. I will implement a **2D Matrix Editor** (Row x Column grid) which is robust and allows precise pattern creation (e.g., walkways, chimneys).

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Interactive Layout Editor ([app.py](file:///c:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/SolarEPC-Pro/app.py))
- **New Feature**: "Layout Manager" Expander.
- **UI Component**: `st.data_editor` showing a grid of checkboxes representing the array.
- **Logic**: 
    - Initialize a DataFrame [(n_rows x n_cols)](file:///c:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/SolarEPC-Pro/tests/test_pvsyst_validation.py#20-31) with all True.
    - User toggles checkboxes to False to "remove" panels.
    - Pass the `active_modules` mask to the visualizer.

### 2. Unified Rendering Engine ([src/design.py](file:///c:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/SolarEPC-Pro/src/design.py))
- **Refactor**: Split [visualize_layout_3d](file:///c:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/SolarEPC-Pro/src/design.py#207-1108) to handle `mounting_type`.
- **Modes**:
    - `Ground (Ballast)`: Current detailed concrete blocks + clamps.
    - `Roof (Flush)`: New mode. Modules parallel to surface, simple rails, no heavy blocks.
- **Logic Update**:
    - Iterate through the `active_modules` mask.
    - Only generate geometry for active modules.
    - Adapt racking geometry based on `mounting_type`.

### 3. Realistic Environment ([src/design.py](file:///c:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/SolarEPC-Pro/src/design.py))
- **Ground Texture**: 
    - Improve the default ground plane to use a noise-based texture or high-res pattern instead of flat color.
    - Better integration with the "Drone Imagery" overlay.

## Verification Plan
### Manual Verification
- **Test Editing**: Uncheck specific modules in the grid -> Verify they disappear in 3D.
- **Test Modes**: Switch between "Ground" and "Roof" -> Verify racking changes from Concrete Blocks to Flush Rails.
- **Test Visuals**: Verify the "Pro" details (frames, clamps) persist in all modes.
